hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2853","###
 Narrated to us Muhammad bin Yahya, who said: Narrated to us Abdullah bin Muhammad Al-Nufayli, who said: Narrated to us Hatim bin Ismail, who said: Narrated to us Ja'far, from his father, who said: We entered upon Jabir bin Abdullah (RA). I said to him, ""Inform me about the Hajj of the Prophet (ﷺ)."" He said, ""He came to Al-Muzdalifah and combined the Maghrib and Isha prayers with one Adhan and two I"
